Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: epistle-panel
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, epistle, podup, glyndor-archive-keyring
Description: web panel for the epistle mail server, installed as a stack service
 epistle-panel is the web interface for epistle: administration
 on top of epistle's management API.
 .
 This package carries no application code and no Node runtime. The panel runs
 only inside its container image, ghcr.io/glyndor/epistle-panel. The package
 installs two small files: one naming the image tag that matches the package
 version, and a README for it. epistle is meant to read the first and add the
 panel service to the stack it generates; the epistle release that does so does
 not exist yet. The package creates no account, no directory outside
 /usr/share and no secret.
